<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIMON kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Philm</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIMON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Philimon chu Khristien inlârtak ania, Colossa koiindanga mi inkhat le suok inkhat a riming Onesimus puma ani. Hi suok hin a pu renga a rot paia, masuole kho angin mini Paul leh intângna ina aom sûngin an hong intong ani. Paul jârin, Onesimus hih Khristien a hong chang zoi ani. <char style="bk">Philimon kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</char> hi Paul'n a kôm a tîr mikhîr pe nôka, a suok hih Philimon'n a lên ngêipui nôk rang le suok ngâidam sai anghan vai niloiin, Khristien lâibung anghan lamdon lei tho ranga ngêna ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Philimon rang Minpâkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimus ranga ngêna <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Paul, Khrista Jisua jâra mi intângpu le ei lâibungpa Timothy renga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kin mal le kin sinthopu champui Philimon kôm, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>le ni insûnga koiindang intûp ngâi ngei le kin sarnu Apphia le kin râlmi champui Archippus:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Pathien ei Pa le Pumapa Jisua Khrista'n moroina le inngêina nangni pêk rese.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philimon lungkhamna le taksônna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Lâibungpa Philimon, chubai ko tho racham ni riming dênin ka Pathien kôm râisânchong ki ril ngâi ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Pathien mingei murdi chunga lungkhamna le Pumapa Jisua han taksônna no dôn tit ke lei riet sikin. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Ku chubaithona tak chu iempungei anghan nangma leh kin inlopkhômna chungroi hin Khrista leh inzoma ei ringnuna satvurna murdi ei dôn ngei hih rietheina inthûk uol amintung theina rangin ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Lâibung moroitak, nu lungkhamna han râisânna lientak le mohôkna tamtak mi mintung pe ani! Pathien mingei mulungngei murdi ni mintâi ani.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimus ranga ngêna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Masika hin Khrista han na lâibungpa anghan imo ni sintho rang ruo chong nang pêk hih ngam bâk rang khom ni ronga. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Aniatachu, manêkin nang ku lungkhamna sikin, keima Paul nikhom ronga, hima hih thôn Khrista Jisua palâi, male atûn hin khom ama jâra mi intângpu nikhom ronga ngêna ko dôn ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista Jisua palâi, le atûn hin khom ama jâra intâng ina om; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">miriem tar, le Khrista Jisua jâra atûn hin intâng ina ompu.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Intângna ina ko om sûngin Khrista taka han ka nâipasal lelê; rathatienga a pa ko hongni, masikin Onesimus ruthûlin no kôm ngêna ko dôn ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ama hih moton han chu nangma rangin mangmunboi ania, aniatachu atûn hin chu aruonin nang rang le kei rangin mangmunomtak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek rimingin Onesimus ti omtie chu “mangmunomtak” tina ani.</char></note> ani zoi.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Atûn hin no kôm ko hongtîr nôka ama lehin ku mulungrîl khom ahong sa ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Masikin, ama hih nu ruthûla ni san theina rangin thurchisa jâra intângna ina ko om sûngin ko kôm hin la dar rang ku nuom ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Nikhomrese, mi san rangin nang dânderit nuom mu unga; manêkin, ma ha chu nu lungdo angin no tho rangin ku nuom ani. Masikin, no jôtna boiin ite tho noning.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Masikin Onesimus'n nangma renga chomolte a rot hih zoratin no dôn nôk kelen theina rang sika khom ani thei. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Atûn hin ama hih suok papai niloiin suok nêka sa uol ok: ama hih Khrista taka han lâibung moroitak ani zoi. Keima ta rangin khodôr tak mo ani rang ni zoi! Male nangma ta rang vângin chu ala ni uol rang, aruonin suok anghan le Pumapa han lâibung anghan ani rang ani zoi!<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Masikin no lôm anghan mi ni mindonin chu, keima lamdon mi ni lei tho rang anghan ama hih lamdon lei tho nôk roh. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Nu chunga a tho minchâina tete aoma, ân tângna tete aom lekhom keima ka lakâiin minsâp roh. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Mahin, ku kut lelên hima hih ki miziek rang: <char style="sig">Keima, Paul'n nang thuon nôk ki tih.</char> (Ko kôma nên tâng khet ti nang ki min rietnôkna chu ni oul mak.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Masikin, ka lâibungpa, rangâihoitakin Pumapa jârin mahi ni tho pe inla; Khrista taka han lâibung anghan, mi mathâi roh! <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Tak ko sônchêt, anghan nang ke ngên hih tho na ta, mapêna khom tho ni tih, tiin ki riet mindik sikin no kôm mahi ki miziek ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Mapên han, ku tungna rang khâltan mi lei mintuo pe roh, Pathien'n nin renga nin chubaithonangei a khôka nin kôm mi hongtîr nôk atih, tiin ka sabei sikin.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoina chibaimûknangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epaphras, Khrista Jisua jâra keima leh intângna ina ompu hin a chibaingei nangni a hong muthuon,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>male ki sintho— champuingei Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, le Luke ngei khomin chibai nangni an hong muthuon sa ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Sin 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 4:11">11</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista moroina hah nin renga nin kôm om rese.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
